<view class="page"><view class="notice">只保存在当前设备。请填写虚构内容，不要输入真实手机号、微信号或其他个人信息。</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="label">标题</text><input class="control" placeholder="2–40 个字符" maxlength="40" value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">分类</text><picker class="control" range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category"><view>{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">学校</text><picker class="control" range="{{schools}}" value="{{schoolIndex}}" bindchange="school"><view>{{schools[schoolIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">描述</text><textarea class="control" placeholder="5–500 个字符，描述你的闲置或需求" maxlength="500" value="{{form.description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">模拟联系方式</text><input class="control" placeholder="例如：虚构联络代号 A01" maxlength="60" value="{{form.contact}}" data-field="contact" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">保存并查看</button></view></view>
